Cell["\<\
Turns out that Q = CV = 1000 is a pt of  stable equilibrium. Also we observe \
that changing R doesn\[CloseCurlyQuote]t affect the stable equilibrium point.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.9463439091840343`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"a726f85c-998a-6d45-905c-\
171f4d88c29d"],

