Cell["\<\
There are two fixed points here as 0 population is also a valid scenario, if \
you take it as an initial condition, population will never increase. Out of \
these, N=k is the stable fixed point (of equilibrium) of the system. If N>K, \
dN/dt is negative.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.946343986205763*^9},ExpressionUUID->"770f180e-c6e2-8f42-925a-\
d45ed877cc71"],

